blacklist btsdio
# etnaviv (the A311D's Vivante VIPNano NPU) is built but kept from loading: enabling the npu DT node
# hung the board at ~7 s of boot (2026-09-25; cause not known yet: power domain, clocks or the driver,
# and this blocklist alone did not prevent the hang). The npu node is disabled again; bring it up by
# hand before changing this.
blacklist etnaviv
